<title>USA: Destec retains adviser to mull options.</title>
<headline>Destec retains adviser to mull options.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Independent power producer Destec Engergy Inc said on Tuesday it decided to retain an investment banking firm to explore its strategic alternatives, including a possible sale of the company.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement its board of directors unanimously decided to retain investment banking firm Morgan Stanley &amp; Co Inc, but that it had made no decision yet about any particular transaction.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
